## 示例：定义实体属性

```java
// init/ModAttributes.java
public class ModAttributes {
    // 在 RegistryEvent.Register<Attribute> 中注册
    public static Attribute EXAMPLE_HEALTH;
    public static Attribute EXAMPLE_DAMAGE;

    @SubscribeEvent
    public static void register(RegistryEvent.Register<Attribute> event) {
        EXAMPLE_HEALTH = new RangedAttribute("attribute.examplemod.health", 100.0, 1.0, 1024.0);
        EXAMPLE_HEALTH.setRegistryName(new ResourceLocation(ExampleMod.MOD_ID, "example.health"));
        event.getRegistry().register(EXAMPLE_HEALTH);

        EXAMPLE_DAMAGE = new RangedAttribute("attribute.examplemod.damage", 2.0, 0.0, 1024.0);
        EXAMPLE_DAMAGE.setRegistryName(new ResourceLocation(ExampleMod.MOD_ID, "example.damage"));
        event.getRegistry().register(EXAMPLE_DAMAGE);
    }
}
```

```java
// ExampleMod.java 构造函数中
public ExampleMod() {
    MinecraftForge.EVENT_BUS.register(new ModAttributes());
}
```

## 示例：实体类

```java
// entities/MyEntity.java
public class MyEntity extends LivingEntity {
    private int attackCooldown = 0;

    protected MyEntity(EntityType<? extends MyEntity> type, Level level) {
        super(type, level);
    }

    @Override
    protected void registerGoals() {
        super.registerGoals();
        this.goalSelector.addGoal(0, new FloatGoal(this));           // 漂浮
        this.goalSelector.addGoal(1, new MeleeAttackGoal(this, 1.0, true));  // 近战攻击
        this.goalSelector.addGoal(2, new WaterAvoidingRandomStrollGoal(this, 1.0));
        this.goalSelector.addGoal(3, new LookAtPlayerGoal(this, Player.class, 8.0f));
        this.goalSelector.addGoal(4, new RandomLookAroundGoal(this));

        this.targetSelector.addGoal(0, new NearestAttackableTargetGoal<>(this, Player.class, true));
    }

    @Override
    protected void onChangedPotionHolder(MobEffectInstance effectInstance) {
        // 药水效果变化时
    }
}
```

## 示例：实体注册

```java
// registry/ModEntities.java
public class ModEntities {
    public static EntityType<MyEntity> MY_ENTITY;

    @SubscribeEvent
    public static void register(RegistryEvent.Register<EntityType<?>> event) {
        MY_ENTITY = EntityType.Builder.of(MyEntity::new, MobCategory.CREATURE)
            .sized(0.6f, 1.8f)
            .clientTrackingRange(8)
            .updateInterval(3)
            .fireImmune()
            .build("my_entity");
        MY_ENTITY.setRegistryName(new ResourceLocation(ExampleMod.MOD_ID, "my_entity"));
        event.getRegistry().register(MY_ENTITY);
    }
}
```

```java
// ExampleMod.java 构造函数中
public ExampleMod() {
    MinecraftForge.EVENT_BUS.register(new ModEntities());
}
```

## 示例：客户端渲染器注册

```java
// client/ClientSetup.java
@Mod.EventBusSubscriber(modid = ExampleMod.MOD_ID, value = Dist.CLIENT)
public class ClientSetup {
    @SubscribeEvent
    public static void onClientSetup(FMLClientSetupEvent event) {
        // 渲染器通过 EntityRenderersEvent.RegisterRenderers 注册
    }

    @SubscribeEvent
    public static void onRegisterRenderers(EntityRenderersEvent.RegisterRenderers event) {
        event.registerEntityRenderer(ModEntities.MY_ENTITY.get(), MyEntityRenderer::new);
    }
}
```

## 示例：渲染器

```java
// client/rendering/MyEntityRenderer.java
public class MyEntityRenderer extends LivingEntityRenderer<MyEntity, MyEntityModel<MyEntity>> {
    public MyEntityRenderer(EntityRendererProvider.Context context) {
        super(context, new MyEntityModel<>(context.bakeLayer(MyEntityModel.LAYER_LOCATION)), 0.5f);
        this.addLayer(new ItemInHandLayer<>(this,
            context.getItemRenderer(), context.getBlockRenderer()));
    }

    @Override
    public ResourceLocation getTextureLocation(MyEntity entity) {
        return new ResourceLocation(ExampleMod.MOD_ID, "textures/entity/my_entity.png");
    }
}
```

> 注意：
> 1. `EntityRenderers` 在 Forge 1.17.1 中通过 `EntityRenderersEvent.RegisterRenderers` 事件注册（不是 `ClientSetup` 中直接调用）
> 2. `ItemInHandLayer` 需要 `EntityRendererProvider.Context` 中的 `ItemRenderer` 和 `BlockRenderer`
> 3. 纹理文件路径：`textures/entity/my_entity.png`（对应 `assets/{modid}/textures/entity/my_entity.png`）
> 4. `EntityModelLayer` 用于定义层标识，通过 `EntityRenderersEvent.RegisterLayerDefinitions` 注册，渲染器中用 `context.bakeLayer()` 获取
